{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1767.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"b376e95f461303257711f93d3e72b0d607e5cc69113f074be856d4dc8221fbde","ja":"試合後のお楽しみ","zh":"赛后的乐趣","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1767.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"1aac2772cfac38b96b663ddcb66508d8bc75f8e0825fd0837adfc34dc2e3723d","ja":"プロレス観戦を満喫したのり子と律子。\n感想を話し合っていたが、ヒートアップしてきて……","zh":"尽情享受了职业摔跤观战的福田のり子和秋月律子。\n两人正在交流感想，却渐渐激动起来……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1767.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"58436874cc12e823b46e696b1a56e6ed2acd3fde22d577a31298997e06d0bdf8","ja":"私は素人だから、特にそう思うのかもしれないけど、\nせっかくなら、もっといろいろ見せてほしいじゃない？","zh":"因为我是外行，可能才会格外这么觉得，不过\n既然机会难得，不是应该让我多看看各种各样的东西吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1767.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"71582ccb8f318441df108ae5813983a39214ccc05d76cae2d2cde3413dbdfbae","ja":"堅実なテクニックの安定感も、捨てがたいわよね！\n相手の一撃をいなしてからのダブルラリアットとか！","zh":"扎实技巧的稳定感也让人难以割舍呢！\n比如躲过对手的一击之后接上双重飞拳之类的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1767.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"93659edc55f80a03c5920b5c28a26a9a44aea879bbb359b37d1b2f748869a521","ja":"ただの力押しじゃない見せ方は、\nお約束だからこそ、決まったら気持ちいいと思うわ！","zh":"这种展现方式不只是靠蛮力，正因为是约定俗成的，定下来的时候才让人觉得痛快！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1767.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"18441a036875a854841d8511cc572cd0510d9f08e5ab1fcba03b8a8f235d734d","ja":"いやいや、もちろんそれは、わかるけど！","zh":"不不不，我当然明白，但是！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1767.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"763afe7333a18b88a7b8f17e8bc8b01924414cba1e423090dc356fd7b5bebe7c","ja":"やっぱり見せ場は、大きくて派手な技で\nガーンと決めるべきだよ！","zh":"果然，重头戏就该用又大又华丽的招式\n一击定胜负！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1767.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"0f20bf8374352592658b60fef6f9dce9ea9078bf1710c4920a469b6ba028ce24","ja":"それは否定しないわ！　でも、\n試合の流れを考えたら、あの場面は……。","zh":"这我不否认！不过，\n考虑到比赛的走势，那个场面……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1767.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"5a37d8ad400c003d56b2742bce6f3906f2fa6c7b34f53da352395380b37d6306","ja":"ザワザワ、ザワザワ…………","zh":"窸窸窣窣、窸窸窣窣…………","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1767.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"1d4ade1b80c90e531c7576d954eb22853d2fc63d4b2e5a12e2844f5b05eb689f","ja":"あっ！　つい声が大きく……。\n周りの人に、迷惑だったわよね……。","zh":"啊！　一不小心声音太大了……。\n给周围的人添麻烦了呢……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1767.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"9445fa125ddfd08f8d48936c568520f9092690f28fd08028e96563be5a61eac3","ja":"そ、そうだね。\nもうちょっと、小さな声で話さなきゃ……。","zh":"是、是啊。\n还得再小声一点说话……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1767.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"4c2af7273855f8fe8808bc13a118244516c47f17d9af815a0c27acd7e45257a0","ja":"パチパチパチパチ！","zh":"啪啪啪啪！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1767.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"c30d06083a7633ce842d5b17758618517f9ddae37740984cdf2c78cb94455cf2","ja":"「いいぞ～、姉ちゃんたち～！」\n「わかるわかる、プロレスの魅力は奥が深いよな～！」","zh":"「好棒～，姐姐们～！」\n「懂懂懂，职业摔跤的魅力真是深奥啊～！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1767.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"19fe40d40d51d01747a6739e2c229ff7f99f9cefae65b12de5dd96bab18a6869","ja":"えっ！？　あ、もしかして……\nさっきの試合会場にいました！？","zh":"诶！？啊，难道说……\n你刚才在比赛会场！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1767.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"22c7f6451d4fbe0ed4d805ca38b8b468aca154826d48fd45b4432896c88ea6b0","ja":"す、すみません。\nでも、同意してくれてありがとうございます！","zh":"对、对不起。\n不过，谢谢你同意！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1767.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"4053043b1b1db68cf504702061088da4314820f5167b39fca785a15c279fc5eb","ja":"そ、それじゃあ私たちはこれで！\nどうもお騒がせしました～！","zh":"那、那我们就先告辞了！\n真是给大家添麻烦了～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1767.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"1161c3eaf32d6ae1660fe4a616c1ce0a7d19a19600a53248e563b76ff8a5f7a8","ja":"……あははははっ！　ごめん律子さん！\nつい熱くなっちゃった！","zh":"……啊哈哈哈！　对不起，律子小姐！\n一不小心就激动起来了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1767.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"b96292af8e9a66c74d3351eda299232b7d41f3a3c319acc21c576dfbdf656664","ja":"こっちこそ。白熱しちゃったのはお互い様よ♪","zh":"我才要这么说呢。变得那么起劲，彼此彼此啦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1767.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"bbee40b4d0c0133bf22203d46cd7d22f182d4bd5ffaf9628a3b449e72e475fb5","ja":"とはいっても、まだまだ語り足りないわよね……。\nこのままごはんしながら、続きといきましょ！","zh":"话虽如此，但也还远远没聊够呢……\n不如就这样边吃饭边接着聊吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1767.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"d2a46a08db4dcd49ba317588129fc95f2b4564acb6b525adb46c048ca17d522a","ja":"あはは、そこまで付き合ってくれるの？","zh":"啊哈哈，你要陪我到那个份上吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1767.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"03e21e2e0bf5c3c194c4b9d2dd3b08f5ea4b456b6de05948e25357b56826760c","ja":"当然よ！　ここからちょっと行ったところに\n個室の和食屋さんがあるから、とことん語り合うわよ！","zh":"当然啦！从这里再往前走一点就有一家有包厢的日料店，\n我们可以畅聊个够！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1767.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"60b2b633c8295851aa4afbae4e7c4df774ae2c6acfe93b70cbbe44ad79f657de","ja":"よーし、それじゃあ今夜は、\n感想と意見の交換会だ～！","zh":"好～，那么今晚\n就来开感想与意见的交流会吧～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
